1. WHAT ALTER IS

Alter is a tool for analysing and reverse engineering Android application
packages (APK files). Among other things it can:
- unpack DEX bytecode from installed apps and APK files, with or without root;
- dump IL2CPP (Unity) metadata and produce a readable dump and helper scripts;
- patch, repackage, inject into, re-sign, or keep the original signature of an
  APK so that it dumps its own contents at runtime;
- merge split application bundles (apks / xapk / apkm) into a single APK;
- generate regular expressions, dialog templates, and other helper content.

Alter is intended for software interoperability research, security analysis,
education, debugging, and working with software that you have created or that
you are otherwise legally permitted to analyse.


